ht|n|at|^*GA1,1.  There are slams that make because of a good fit but cannot be bid^*N|
                  
ht|o|at|^*GA1,2.  Sometimes, bidding minors can be a dilemma^*N|
                  
ht|p|at|^*GA3,3.  A sophisticated raise convention^*N|
                  
ht|q|at|^*GA4,4.  With 4-card support and a weak hand responder should raise to three level of the major^*N|
                  
ht|r|at|^*GA5,5.  The Art of Finesse^*N|
                  
ht|s|at|^*GA6,6.  It is usually right to bid 4@S over 4@H with a 9-card fit^*N|

