https://tinyurl.com/2565nbga
qx|A3|st||rh||ah|Board 3 IMPs   -   On January 1, 2025|pn|hondo717,IraCT,danpsych,Sputniks|
md|1SA964HK7DJ864CAJ3,SK83HAJT43D73CK52,SJT2H96DKQ5CT9864,SQ75HQ852DAT92CQ7|sv|e|
mb|1D|mb|1H|mb|P2h|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|2@H is not the correct bid for two reasons. The more important reason is that, 2@H, only shows 3-card heart support and almost always denies 4-card support. With 4 hearts and a weak hand you should raise to 3@H. |
PG| ***** 43 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|On this hand, East has a limit raise, so not only does 2@H show the wrong number of hearts, it shows the wrong number of points. I would bid 2@D with the East hand.|
PG| ***** 44 ***** |


ub||
PG| ***** 45 ***** |


mb|2D|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|There is also a more sophisticated raise convention that I play when it is available. It doesn't apply here as East has a limit raise. But the problem is when the bidding goes 1@D-1@H-P-3@H, 3@H shows a wide range of strength from as little as 2 or 3 to as much as 8 or 9.|
PG| ***** 46 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Note that 3@D is also available as a cue bid. So if it goes 1@D-1@H-P-3@D, I play that as showing a constructive raise in hearts (4 hearts and 7-9 points). |
PG| ***** 47 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|That bid is sometimes not available but when it is, it is a nice convention, although very few play it. That way, when it goes 1@D-1@H-3@H, 3@H shows a weak hand (2-6) and the 1@H bidder is not tempted to bid 4 even with a strong 1@H overcall.|
PG| ***** 48 ***** |


mb|P|mb|3H|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|mb|P|mb|P|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|3@H is a very good bid. West wants to show an invitational hand opposite a limit raise and West does have 13 |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=declarerpoints,Bergen Declarer Points^*N|CP||FP||at|. They are 11 HCP, 1 length point, 1 point for the quality heart suit. And East correctly passed with her minimum limit raise.|
PG| ***** 49 ***** |


