mb|P|mb|1H|mb|P?|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Some players might be tempted to bid 1@S with my hand. But I highly recommend, with 4-card support of a major, you must raise immediately. Otherwise you deny 4-card support.|
