nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|3@D is not diamonds. It is a |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=bergenraises,Bergen Raises^*N|CP||FP||AT| showing 4 hearts and 7-9 points.|
