nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Note that Bergen devalues flat hands with only 1 doubleton and no singletons or voids as it should. Regardless, North has 20 points more than enough to bid 4@H.|
