UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I think there are reasonable ways to play the spade suit that will result in only 2 losers even if the defense doesn't lead spades. One is to play East for the Queen or 10 of spades. After drawing 3 rounds of trump, I think the best way to play the hand is to lead the @S9 and finesse East for the 10. Once West shows up with the 10 then North should lead the @SJ and hope East has the Queen.|
PG| ***** 81 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Alternatively, which is also a reasonable play North can play East for the @SA or @S10 and after losing to the @S10, lead a low spade towards the @SK. It is basically a guess since there was not much bidding.

|
PG| ***** 82 ***** |


