UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Note had Declarer played the @CA at trick one, he would have gone down. Even if you are pretty sure a finesse is losing, unless you are 100% sure, which was certainly not the case here, then, unless you have a very good reason not to, you might as well try even if the odds are against you.|
